{"parentUuid":"041fe82b-ade8-4a85-8c4e-2a9357af48f4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Cjr1BRUDWTMcnfD9H4eemd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has 4 sessions split by domain:\n1. Branding session\n2. Inner actions (이너렉션 - animation/interaction) session\n3. Three.js session\n4. WebGL session\n\nLet me think about the overlap risks here. Three.js and WebGL sessions would very likely touch overlapping files since Three.js IS WebGL essentially. The animation/interaction session might also touch Three.js-related files.\n\nLet me give practical advice about whether this split makes sense and what the risks are.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":797,"cache_read_input_tokens":20925,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":797},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaRXpragawTf51accMUBg","type":"assistant","uuid":"2b59b599-127b-44cd-a1f1-55fb026af100","timestamp":"2026-04-26T01:41:42.942Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\edn_y\\renew_nineonelabs","sessionId":"e670ddef-db86-47e8-801d-40c642f32125","version":"2.1.86","gitBranch":"260414"}
{"parentUuid":"2b59b599-127b-44cd-a1f1-55fb026af100","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Cjr1BRUDWTMcnfD9H4eemd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"그 분리는 꽤 위험한 조합이에요.\n\n**문제: Three.js ↔ WebGL 세션**\nThree.js는 WebGL 위에서 돌아가는 거라 `resource/ts/pages/*/scene/`, `WorksSceneManager.ts`, `AppManager` 쪽 파일이 완전히 겹쳐요. 이 두 세션이 같은 파일 건드리면 거의 확실히 덮어쓰기 충돌 납니다.\n\n**문제: 이너렉션 ↔ Three.js**\n인터랙션 로직이 Three.js 씬에 붙어있는 경우 많아서 (Theatre bindings, runtime 이벤트) 이것도 겹침 가능성 높아요.\n\n**브랜딩은 상대적으로 안전**\n`brand/*.md`, SCSS 토큰, 카피 쪽이면 파일 충돌 위험 낮음.\n\n---\n\n**추천 분리 기준 (파일 경계 기준):**\n\n| 세션 | 담당 파일 |\n|------|-----------|\n| 브랜딩 | `brand/`, `resource/scss/`, `views/` |\n| PHP/백엔드 | `routes/`, `inc/`, `views/*.php`, `api/` |\n| 씬/Three.js | `resource/ts/pages/*/scene/`, `theatre/` |\n| 공유 런타임 | `resource/ts/engine/`, `AppManager`, `WorksSceneManager` |\n\n지금 4개 세션에서 각각 어떤 작업 시키고 있어요? 구체적인 파일 보면 실제 충돌 위험도 판단할 수 있어요."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":797,"cache_read_input_tokens":20925,"output_tokens":634,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":797,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaRXpragawTf51accMUBg","type":"assistant","uuid":"5ca17dbd-5297-4653-82b5-ccfdf31b028f","timestamp":"2026-04-26T01:41:51.457Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\edn_y\\renew_nineonelabs","sessionId":"e670ddef-db86-47e8-801d-40c642f32125","version":"2.1.86","gitBranch":"260414"}
